('127.295.d.8.D.iii',4,'To show each department''s share of a total budget, a spreadsheet user would most likely create a:','["Footer", "Blank worksheet", "Macro-free template", "Pie chart"]'::jsonb,3,'Pie charts show parts of a whole.','original')
